      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scottcurls an der Maschine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Machine Shoulder (Military) Press" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schulterdrücken (Military) an der Maschine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Machine Triceps Extension" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trizepsstrecken an der Maschine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain a neutral spine and keep the rest of your body straight, your shoulders being the only joints allowed to move." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte die Wirbelsäule neutral und den restlichen Körper gerade; nur die Schultern bewegen sich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain good posture, and place your free hand behind your back. This will be your starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte eine gute Haltung und lege die freie Hand auf den Rücken. Das ist deine Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain the position of your lumbar and pelvis as you perform the movement, as your back is going to want to arch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte Lendenwirbelsäule und Becken während der Bewegung in Position, denn dein Rücken wird ins Hohlkreuz gehen wollen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain the rigid position with your arms. Slowly descend back to the starting position with your back arched around the Bosu Ball and your abdominals elongated." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte die Arme fest in Position. Senke dich langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition, den Rücken um den Bosu-Ball gewölbt und die Bauchmuskeln gestreckt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain your rigid stance and straight arms. Return to the neutral position in a slow and controlled manner. Your arms should be extended in front of you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte den festen Stand und die gestreckten Arme. Kehre langsam und kontrolliert in die neutrale Position zurück. Deine Arme sind vor dir gestreckt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintain your stance and straight arms. Return to the neutral position in a slow and controlled manner." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte den Stand und die gestreckten Arme. Kehre langsam und kontrolliert in die neutrale Position zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining a neutral grip, palms facing each other, begin with your arms extended directly above you, perpendicular to the floor. This will be your starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Greife im Neutralgriff, die Handflächen zueinander, und beginne mit gestreckten Armen direkt über dir, senkrecht zum Boden. Das ist deine Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining a straight, rigid torso, descend slowly by allowing the elbows to flex." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte den Oberkörper gerade und fest und senke dich langsam ab, indem du die Ellbogen beugst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining control and stability, extend through the elbow to complete the motion." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bleib kontrolliert und stabil und strecke die Ellbogen, um die Bewegung abzuschließen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining good posture, fully extend one leg, pausing at the top of the motion." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte eine gute Haltung, strecke ein Bein ganz und halte oben kurz inne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining good posture, lower yourself by flexing the knee and hip, going down as far as flexibility allows." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte eine gute Haltung und senke dich ab, indem du Knie und Hüfte beugst, so weit deine Beweglichkeit es zulässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining strict technique with no leg drive or leaning back, extend through the elbow to raise the weights together directly above your head." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte die Technik sauber, ohne Schwung aus den Beinen oder Zurücklehnen, und strecke die Ellbogen, um die Gewichte zusammen direkt über den Kopf zu drücken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining the slight bend of the elbows, move the weights out and away from each other (to the side) in an arc motion while exhaling. Tip: Try to squeeze your shoulder blades together to get the best results from this exercise." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte die Ellbogen leicht gebeugt und führe die Gewichte ausatmend in einem Bogen auseinander zur Seite. Tipp: Ziehe die Schulterblätter zusammen, um das Beste aus der Übung herauszuholen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maintaining the slight bend of the elbows, move the weights out and away from each other in an arc motion while exhaling." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte die Ellbogen leicht gebeugt und führe die Gewichte ausatmend in einem Bogen auseinander."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure that your back is erect and your feet are shoulder width apart from each other. This is the starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Rücken ist aufrecht, die Füße stehen schulterbreit. Das ist die Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure that your feet (especially the toes) are well positioned on the floor and place your upper arms on top of the pad located on the inside part of the preacher bench." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Achte darauf, dass deine Füße (vor allem die Zehen) fest auf dem Boden stehen, und lege die Oberarme auf das Polster an der Innenseite der Scottbank."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure that your upper arm is stationary, perpendicular to the floor with elbows in and palms facing forward. Your non lifting arm should be grabbing your waist. This will allow you to keep your balance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Oberarm bleibt ruhig und senkrecht zum Boden, der Ellbogen eng, die Handfläche nach vorn. Mit der freien Hand hältst du dich an der Hüfte fest. So bleibst du im Gleichgewicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure the hand you are not using to lift the weight is placed by your side." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege die freie Hand neben dich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure the palms of the hands are facing each other. This will be your starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Handflächen zeigen zueinander. Das ist deine Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure to rotate your wrists so that the palms of your hands are facing forward. This is your starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drehe die Handgelenke so, dass die Handflächen nach vorn zeigen. Das ist deine Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure your feet are elevated and resting on a flat surface." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege die Füße erhöht auf eine ebene Fläche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measure the distance from your landing point to the starting point and track results." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Miss die Weite vom Absprung bis zur Landung und notiere die Ergebnisse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medicine Ball Chest Pass" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medizinball-Brustpass"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medicine Ball Full Twist" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
