        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbell back to starting position as your breathe in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhantel einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbell back to the starting position as your breathe in. Tip: Remember to twist the palms back to the starting position (facing your thighs) as you come down." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhantel einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition. Tipp: Drehe die Handfläche beim Absenken zurück in die Ausgangsposition (zu den Oberschenkeln)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back down using the pronated grip." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke die Kurzhanteln im Obergriff langsam ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to starting position as your breathe in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhantel einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to starting position as your breathe in. Caution: Avoid swinging motions at any time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhantel einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition. Vorsicht: Hole nie Schwung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to the starting position as your breathe in and as you rotate the wrists back to a neutral grip." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhanteln einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition und drehe die Handgelenke dabei zurück in den Neutralgriff."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to the starting position as your breathe in. Remember to rotate the wrists as you lower the weight in order to switch back to a neutral grip." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhanteln einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition. Drehe beim Absenken die Handgelenke, um wieder in den Neutralgriff zu kommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to the starting position as your breathe in. Remember to rotate your arms as you lower the dumbbells so that you can switch back to a neutral grip." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Kurzhanteln einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition. Drehe dabei die Arme, damit du wieder in den Neutralgriff kommst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to curl the single handle upwards while keeping the upper arm stationary until your forearm touches your bicep while exhaling. Tip: Only the forearm should move." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Curle den Griff ausatmend langsam nach oben, der Oberarm bleibt ruhig, bis der Unterarm den Bizeps berührt. Tipp: Nur der Unterarm bewegt sich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to lift the barbell upwards and exhale. Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the biceps." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hebe die Langhantel ausatmend langsam an. Halte die Spannung eine Sekunde und drücke den Bizeps zusammen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to lower the barbell until it is level with your chin while inhaling." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke die Stange einatmend langsam, bis sie auf Höhe deines Kinns ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to lower the dumbbell down as you breathe in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke die Kurzhantel einatmend langsam ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to lower your arms, legs and chest back down to the starting position while inhaling." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke Arme, Beine und Brust einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to lower your torso and arms back down to the starting position while inhaling. Remember to keep your arms straight out pointing towards your toes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke Oberkörper und Arme einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition. Halte die Arme dabei gestreckt zu den Zehen gerichtet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to lower your torso back down to the starting position while inhaling." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke den Oberkörper einatmend langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly bend the knees and lower your legs until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Make sure to inhale as this is the eccentric part of the exercise." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beuge die Knie langsam und senke dich ab, bis die Oberschenkel parallel zum Boden sind. Atme beim Absenken ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly bring back the arms to the starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bring die Arme langsam zurück in die Ausgangsposition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly bring the barbell back down while inhaling. Tip: Make sure to bend your knees while lowering the weight to avoid any injury from occurring." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senke die Langhantel einatmend langsam ab. Tipp: Beuge beim Absenken die Knie, um Verletzungen zu vermeiden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly bring the raised leg back to the floor as you breathe in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
